<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Chips/Technologies cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Chips/Technologies cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said analyst Erika Klauer downgraded Chips and Technologies Inc to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- said &quot;we are nervous about (the company) over the next two quarters.&quot;</p>
<p>-- lowered earnings estimates to $1.20 per share from $1.25 for 1997, and to $0.75 from $1 for 1998.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 1/2 to 9-1/4.</p>
</text>
